00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,372
Silver is the best conductor of heat and electricity of all metals, the metal of Nepali jewellery and the old mohar coins.

2
00:00:08,372 --> 00:00:13,906
Most silver today is a by product of lead, zinc and copper refining.

3
00:00:13,906 --> 00:00:17,265
Its chief ore is argentite, silver sulphide.

